## Publishing to Building Map Explorer

Source of truth stays in this folder (QR360). After a new version:

```powershell
cd C:\Users\Robert\Projects\QR-East_Industrial_Database
npm run sync:qr360-viewer
```

That copies the latest `QR-360-Inspections_v*.html` into:

- `QR-East_Industrial_Database/qr360-viewer/` (versioned, stamped **Map360**)
- `QR-East_Industrial_Database/public/insp360/viewer.html` (live iframe, stamped **Map360**)
